{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":28,"count":28,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L04-1-22\",\"賣\",\"賣\",\"卖\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這家餐廳賣飲料嗎？","pinyin":"Zhè jiā cāntīng mài yǐnliào ma?","english":"Does this restaurant sell beverage?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-22","sourceFront":"賣","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他們賣很多種飲料。","pinyin":"Tāmen mài hěn duō zhǒng yǐnliào.","english":"They have various kinds of drink.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-01","sourceFront":"咖啡","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"太好了！我最愛吃牛肉麵。他們也賣飲料嗎？","pinyin":"Tài hǎo le! Wǒ zuì ài chī niúròu miàn. Tāmen yě mài yǐnliào ma?","english":"That is awesome! Beef noodles is my favorite. Do they sell drinks as well?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-01","sourceFront":"咖啡","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"a 士(scholar) takes a 買(buy) and flips it around → to 賣(sell)."},{"key":"[\"B1L09-2-08\",\"语言\",\"語言\",\"语言\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"可是這些時間我都有語言交換，不能去。","pinyin":"Kěshì zhèxiē shíjiān wǒ dōu yǒu yǔyán jiāohuàn, bù néng qù.","english":"But I will be doing language exchange during that time. I can’t make it.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"現在我非常忙，沒有很多時間讀書，可是因為有語言交換，所以我的中文進步了。","pinyin":"Xiànzài wǒ fēicháng máng, méi yǒu hěn duō shíjiān dúshū, kěshì yīnwèi yǒu yǔyán jiāohuàn, suǒyǐ wǒ de Zhōngwén jìnbù le.","english":"Nowadays, I am very busy; I don’t have much time for studying. However, because of language exchange, I have improved (my Chinese) a lot.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L15-3-06\",\"比赛\",\"比賽\",\"比赛\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"今天下午學校有籃球比賽，我們去看吧！","pinyin":"Jīntiān xiàwǔ xuéxiào yǒu lánqiú bǐsài, wǒmen qù kàn ba!","english":"There is a basketball game at school this afternoon. Let’s go watch it!","sourceCardId":"B1L06-3-13","sourceFront":"比賽","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L16-1-11\",\"北\",\"北\",\"北\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"台灣從北到南有三百八十五公里。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L16-3-05","sourceFront":"公里","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3},{"chinese":"台北是一個又熱鬧又方便的城市。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L14-1-23","sourceFront":"台北","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我已經在台北住了三十年了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L14-1-03","sourceFront":"住","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"山本良介要從台北車站搭捷運回去。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-2-09","sourceFront":"回去","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"除了台北101，你還去過哪些地方？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-2-08","sourceFront":"還","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"龍山寺是台北很有名的寺廟，廟裡常常有很多外國遊客。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-26","sourceFront":"廟","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"台北市在台灣的北部，有很多大樓。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-2-02","sourceFront":"市","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在台北市租房子太貴了，住在郊區可以省一點兒錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-11","sourceFront":"省錢","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我買了幾包花蓮當地的名產，要送給台北的朋友。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-04","sourceFront":"名產","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這條鐵路從北部一直到南部，一共三百公里。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-20","sourceFront":"鐵路","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這班車早上七點從台北出發，只停了三個站就到花蓮了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-25","sourceFront":"出發","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今年台北101跨年的人比去年增加了十萬人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-36","sourceFront":"增加","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有了捷運以後，台北市的交通情況改善了很多。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-09","sourceFront":"改善","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有了捷運以後，台北市的交通情況改善了很多。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-10","sourceFront":"情況","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"台北101大樓的樣子看起來就像竹子一樣節節高升。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-2-15","sourceFront":"竹子","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在中國，大多數南方人吃飯，北方人吃麵和水餃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-16","sourceFront":"南方","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在中國，大多數南方人吃飯，北方人吃麵和水餃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-17","sourceFront":"北方","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"日本在台灣的東北方；台灣在中國的東南方。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-03","sourceFront":"東北","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"日本在台灣的東北方；台灣在中國的東南方。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-05","sourceFront":"東南","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"台灣南部地區的天氣比北部好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-19","sourceFront":"地區","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"便利的交通，不僅縮短了南北城市的距離，也節省了人們寶貴的時間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-28","sourceFront":"縮短","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"氣象預報說，從明天起一連三天，中部以北地氣溫只有十五度，出門時最好加件外套。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-34","sourceFront":"氣溫","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺灣是一個南北長約三百八十公里的海島，約有兩千三百五十萬人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-13","sourceFront":"約","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺北美術館最近舉辦了很有名的畫展，吸引了很多民眾去欣賞那些畫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-16","sourceFront":"欣賞","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"中國南北方的飲食習慣有一些差異，南方人多吃米飯，北方人多吃餃子、饅頭等麵食。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-15","sourceFront":"米飯","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺北當地的夜市有很多好吃的宵夜，改天我帶你去嘗嘗。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-11","sourceFront":"消夜","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在冬天，臺灣南部比北部暖和，你可以到南部享受暖暖的陽光。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-49","sourceFront":"暖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個旅行團的目的地是中國北京(Beijing)，旅客目的是參觀古蹟及拜訪朋友。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-17","sourceFront":"目的地","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我請旅行社代訂從台北直飛美國的班機，機票較貴，但能節省不少時間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-44","sourceFront":"直飛","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在中國北方，所謂的「大夫」就是醫師，做的是替人醫病的工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-34","sourceFront":"醫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"The left figure leans back to back with a 匕(spoon) twin → facing away: 北(north)."},{"key":"[\"B2L07-1-14\",\"公路\",\"公路\",\"公路\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這條公路很危險，一下大雨，山上的石頭就會掉下來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-17","sourceFront":"下來","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"東部山區一連下了好幾天的大雨，有些房子倒了，公路也塌了，造成不少意外。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-13","sourceFront":"山區","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L12-1-12\",\"所\",\"所\",\"所\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"現在我非常忙，沒有很多時間讀書，可是因為有語言交換，所以我的中文進步了。","pinyin":"Xiànzài wǒ fēicháng máng, méi yǒu hěn duō shíjiān dúshū, kěshì yīnwèi yǒu yǔyán jiāohuàn, suǒyǐ wǒ de Zhōngwén jìnbù le.","english":"Nowadays, I am very busy; I don’t have much time for studying. However, because of language exchange, I have improved (my Chinese) a lot.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"下個星期華語課有期中考，我有一點兒緊張，所以每天晚上都讀書，也練習寫字，希望下個星期的考試能考得很好。","pinyin":"Xià ge xīngqí Huáyǔ kè yǒu qízhōngkǎo, wǒ yǒu yìdiǎnr jǐnzhāng, suǒyǐ měi tiān wǎnshang dōu dúshū, yě liànxí xiězì, xīwàng xià ge xīngqí de kǎoshì néng kǎo de hěn hǎo.","english":"I will have the midterm exam for Chinese class next week. I am a bit nervous so I study every night and practice writing Chinese characters as well. I hope I can do well on the exam next week.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"百貨公司裡有很多衣服、鞋子和皮包，都是最新的，所以很多年輕女生喜歡到百貨公司去，漂亮的、流行的衣服，她們都想穿穿看。","pinyin":"Bǎihuògōngsī lǐ yǒu hěn duō yīfu, xiézi hé píbāo, dōu shì zuì xīn de, suǒyǐ hěn duō niánqīng nǚshēng xǐhuān dào bǎihuògōngsī qù, piàoliang de, liúxíng de yīfu, tāmen dōu xiǎng chuānchuān kàn.","english":"Clothes, shoes and purses in department stores are all the latest; therefore, many young ladies like to go there and try on both beautiful and trendy items.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-3-01","sourceFront":"年輕","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我覺得有的舊東西很不錯，有的新東西也很有趣，我很喜歡看新車、新衣服，可是因為我的錢不多，所以我不常買。","pinyin":"Wǒ juéde yǒude jiù dōngxi hěn búcuò, yǒude xīn dōngxi yě hěn yǒuqù, wǒ hěn xǐhuān kàn xīn chē, xīn yīfu, kěshì yīnwèi wǒ de qián bù duō, suǒyǐ wǒ bù cháng mǎi.","english":"I think some old stuff is good and some new ones are interesting. I like to check the new car, new clothes out, but I do not have much money, so I don’t buy them often.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-3-01","sourceFront":"年輕","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"是啊，因為這個牌子很有名，衣服、褲子和裙子也都很好看，所以很多人買。","pinyin":"Shì a, yīnwèi zhè ge páizi hěn yǒumíng, yīfu, kùzi hé qúnzi yě dōu hěn hǎokàn, suǒyǐ hěn duō rén mǎi.","english":"Yes, it is. This brand is very famous and its tops, pants and skirts are very beautiful, so many people buy it.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-1-01","sourceFront":"裙子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 戶(single door) leans open while an 斤(axe) rests beside it → the marked 所(place)."},{"key":"[\"B2L15-1-28\",\"教师节\",\"教師節\",\"教师节\",\"Name\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"「教師節」這個節日是為了紀念偉大的孔子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-05","sourceFront":"節日","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L02-2-11\",\"乐趣\",\"樂趣\",\"乐趣\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"對我來說，冬天的樂趣就是戴著厚厚的手套，和朋友玩雪球。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-11","sourceFront":"樂趣","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這家公司出版的小說，陪著不少讀者一塊兒成長，也帶給他們無窮的樂趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-02","sourceFront":"無窮","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"登山的時候得注意安全，事前多準備，才能享受登山的樂趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-37","sourceFront":"登山","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有時改變原來旅行的安排，可能會帶來不同的樂趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-38","sourceFront":"原來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L04-1-19\",\"清楚\",\"清楚\",\"清楚\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"尚恩是家豪的好朋友，非常清楚他的個性，連他喜歡吃什麼都很清楚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-19","sourceFront":"清楚","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"店員把這台咖啡機的特色說明得非常清楚，聽了他的說明以後，大家都很感興趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-13","sourceFront":"說明","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"黃先生這幾天一直發燒，腦子很不清楚，恐怕沒辦法寫劇本。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-17","sourceFront":"腦","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"店員把筆電的功能說明得很清楚，所以客人都明白了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-17","sourceFront":"明白","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"老師的回答很清楚，所以學生都懂了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-22","sourceFront":"回答","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"很多外國學生弄不清楚漢字的聲調。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-08","sourceFront":"清楚","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"老師把這個生字清楚地寫在黑板上。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-07","sourceFront":"生字","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我在山上工作，手機的訊號很弱，朋友常抱怨我的電話不是打不通，就是聲音不清楚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-25","sourceFront":"弱","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我同學記筆記的速度很快，也記得很清楚，所以我常跟他借筆記來複習功課。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-17","sourceFront":"記","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:你知道辦理留學的手續需要準備哪些資料嗎？ B:我不清楚。你可以上網查查。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-04","sourceFront":"辦理","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"與人溝通時，最重要的是讓對方清楚了解你想表達的意思。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-04","sourceFront":"與","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你們之間的誤會越來越深，要是不面對面說清楚，恐怕連朋友都當不成了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-11","sourceFront":"對","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老婆：我叫你買豆漿，怎麼買了無糖的，真難喝！ 老公：妳又沒說清楚，怎麼能怪我。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-32","sourceFront":"怪","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chin