{"chinese":"週末的時候，火車站的賣票窗口總是排滿了人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-32","sourceFront":"窗口","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"自從有了抽號機以後，人們就不需要站著排隊了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-13","sourceFront":"抽號機","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"今天客人跟著小溫去參觀工廠，也試用了新產品，一切安排都令他十分滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-24","sourceFront":"一切","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"只要照溫老師安排的課程，多閱讀、多練習，你的中文就會有很大的進步。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-03","sourceFront":"進步","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"張經理今天的工作行程安排得很滿，連吃飯、休息的時間都沒有。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-14","sourceFront":"滿","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"華語中心除了有培養學生中文能力的課程，還安排了文化課，讓課程更豐富。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-32","sourceFront":"培養","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"顏先生對吃、喝都很講究，吃牛排時應該喝什麼酒，他也很有研究。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-11","sourceFront":"講究","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"現在突然下起了大雨，我們的計畫被破壞了，恐怕今天所有的活動都必須重新安排。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-18","sourceFront":"重新","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"公司很重視員工的身心健康，每年都安排一連五天的環島旅行，家人也可以參加。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-19","sourceFront":"身心","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這個週末你有什麼安排？要不要一起去看電影？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-02","sourceFront":"安排","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"雖然我排隊排了一個小時才買到跨年演唱會的票，可是很值得。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-27","sourceFront":"值得","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"你只買了一份雞排，吃得飽嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-21","sourceFront":"飽","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"炸雞排是我最喜歡的小吃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-1-15","sourceFront":"雞排","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"火車應該快到了，我們去前面排隊吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-22","sourceFront":"應該","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"捷運站的洗手間外面有很多人在排隊，你要去嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L16-2-06","sourceFront":"廁所","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"公園的音樂晚會快要開始了，可不可以請你們幫我排那些椅子？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L15-3-09","sourceFront":"排","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"現在坐捷運的人很多，我們需要排隊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L13-2-02","sourceFront":"排隊","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"參加旅行團或自助旅遊各有各的優點，懶得自己安排行程的人，就跟著導遊走吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-12","sourceFront":"旅行團","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每年安排一段時間去旅行，說不定能帶給你更豐富的生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-20","sourceFront":"說不定","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我逛街時經過了一排小吃攤，就買幾樣回來當作宵夜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-39","sourceFront":"排","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家工廠排出的黑煙不只氣味難聞，更可怕的是可能對肺部造成傷害。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-14","sourceFront":"煙","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"學校安排我們到鄉下當「一日農民」，體驗農夫的辛苦。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-40","sourceFront":"農民","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這對情侶找了幾位朋友商量，一起安排結婚典禮。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-17","sourceFront":"商量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"她在嬰兒車上安裝了一排不同顏色的小燈，看起來很特別。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-15","sourceFront":"安裝","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有時改變原來旅行的安排，可能會帶來不同的樂趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-38","sourceFront":"原來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"夏天到了，我們去海邊走走，順便去打個海灘排球。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-46","sourceFront":"排球","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一開始奧運僅安排男子比賽項目，後來才有女子項目的比賽。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-12","sourceFront":"男子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"a 扌(hand) takes the 非(fēi) ticket line → everyone must 排(line up)."},{"key":"[\"B4L13-1-28\",\"移\",\"移\",\"移\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我想在床旁邊擺個書桌，不過空間不太夠，你可以幫我把床移到牆邊嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-28","sourceFront":"移","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"根據氣象資料，這個颱風未來兩天會往西移動，週五起對台灣產生影響。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-27","sourceFront":"移動","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L14-1-51\",\"百闻不如一见\",\"百聞不如一見\",\"百闻不如一见\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L15-2-16\",\"张\",\"張\",\"张\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這張畫很好看，我很喜歡。","pinyin":"Zhè zhāng huà hěn hǎokàn, wǒ hěn xǐhuān.","english":"This painting is brilliant. I like it very much.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-3-10","sourceFront":"畫","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"客廳裡面有兩張沙發。","pinyin":"Kètīng lǐmiàn yǒu liǎng zhāng shāfā.","english":"There are two sofas in the living room.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-19","sourceFront":"沙發","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"你的房間裡有幾張椅子？","pinyin":"Nǐ de fángjiān lǐ yǒu jǐ zhāng yǐzi?","english":"How many chairs are there in your room?","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-14","sourceFront":"有","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我要買一張桌子跟四張椅子。","pinyin":"Wǒ yào mǎi yì zhāng zhuōzi gēn sì zhāng yǐzi.","english":"I want to buy one table and four chairs.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-12","sourceFront":"張","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"下個星期華語課有期中考，我有一點兒緊張，所以每天晚上都讀書，也練習寫字，希望下個星期的考試能考得很好。","pinyin":"Xià ge xīngqí Huáyǔ kè yǒu qízhōngkǎo, wǒ yǒu yìdiǎnr jǐnzhāng, suǒyǐ měi tiān wǎnshang dōu dúshū, yě liànxí xiězì, xīwàng xià ge xīngqí de kǎoshì néng kǎo de hěn hǎo.","english":"I will have the midterm exam for Chinese class next week. I am a bit nervous so I study every night and practice writing Chinese characters as well. I hope I can do well on the exam next week.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"不舒服\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"不(not) + 舒(relaxed) + 服(clothes) → not relaxed in your clothes, so you feel sick."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"又\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A right hand curves out to grab one more item → 又(again)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"因為\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"因(because) + 為(for) → because of/for this reason, meaning 'because'."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"本來\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"本(root) + 來(come) → the root from which it comes means 'originally'."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"烈\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 列(line) of 灬(fire) blazes in a row, each one fierce and scorching hot, a burning line of intense heat — 烈(fiery)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"燈\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 火(fire) flame rests on the 登(rise) ladder → one bright 燈(lamp)."}]}
